# Intentionally minimal. cmux reads this path, and it used to hold the real
# appearance -- the custom purple palette plus a tmux passthrough keybind
# block. Because it lives outside the dotfiles repo, a new machine rendered
# a different (duller) theme, and the tmux binds shadowed cmux commands.
#
# All of it now lives in git:
#   ~/workspace/dotfiles/ghostty/config -> ~/.config/ghostty/config
#
# Tracked in dotfiles and symlinked here. Nothing writes this file
# automatically, so unlike the cmux one the symlink should persist.
